#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:68 imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:299
#: imageplugin_freerotation.cpp:63
msgid "Free Rotation"
msgstr "Rotazón Libre"

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:70
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to process free image rotation."
msgstr "Un plugin de digiKam para procesar a rotazón libre das imaxes."

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:77
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autor e mantimento"

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:80
msgid "Free Rotation algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritmo de Rotazón Libre"

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:85
msgid ""
"<p>This is the free image operation preview. If you move the mouse cursor on "
"this preview, a vertical and horizontal dashed line will be drawn to guide you "
"in adjusting the free rotation correction. Release the left mouse button to "
"freeze the dashed line's position."
msgstr ""
"<p>Esta é a antevisión da operazón de rotazón libre. Se move o cursor do rato "
"nesta antevisión mostrarán-se liñas discontínuas, horizontais e verticais, para "
"guiá-lo ao axustar o ángulo de rotazón. Prema no botón esquerdo do rato para "
"fixar a posizón das liñas discontínuas."

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:100
msgid "New width:"
msgstr "Nova largura:"

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:101 imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:105
#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:291 imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:292
msgid " px"
msgstr " píxels"

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:104
msgid "New height:"
msgstr "Nova altura:"

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:116
msgid "Main angle:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:120
msgid ""
"<p>An angle in degrees by which to rotate the image. A positive angle rotates "
"the image clockwise; a negative angle rotates it counter-clockwise."
msgstr ""
"<p>Un ángulo en graus polo cal rotar a imaxe. Un ángulo positivo rota a imaxe "
"no sentido horário, un negativo no sentido contrário."

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:127
msgid "Fine angle:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:131
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>This value in degrees will be added to main angle value to set fine target "
"angle."
msgstr ""
"<p>Este valor será engadido ao Ángulo Principal para axustar ao detalle o "
"ángulo obxectivo."

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:137
msgid "Anti-Aliasing"
msgstr "Anti-Aliasing"

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:138
msgid ""
"<p>Enable this option to process anti-aliasing filter to the rotated image. To "
"smooth the target image, it will be blurred a little."
msgstr ""
"<p>Active esta opzón para aplicar o filtro de anti-aliasing (suavizazón) na "
"imaxe rotada. Ao suavizar a imaxe, esta será lixeiramente difundida."

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:143
msgid "Auto-crop:"
msgstr "Recorte automático:"

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:145
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nengun"

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:146
msgid "Widest Area"
msgstr "Área Mais Ancha"

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:147
msgid "Largest Area"
msgstr "Área Maior"

#: imageeffect_freerotation.cpp:148
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the method to process image auto-cropping to remove black frames "
"around a rotated image."
msgstr ""
"<p>Escolla aqui o método para procesar o auto-recorte de imaxe para eliminar os "
"bordes negros arredor dunha imaxe rotada."

#: imageplugin_freerotation.cpp:43
msgid "Free Rotation..."
msgstr "Rotazón Libre..."

